  "headingOutline": [
    "H1: Data strategy that drives your business forward.",
    "H2: Your data defines your future.",
    "H2: Don’t just plan it, build it.",
    "H2: Your complete data journey.",
    "H2: Data strategies that are relied on by the world's best-run companies.",
    "H3: Creating a three-year Al roadmap for the Government's Insolvency Service.",
    "H2: Meet the Aiimi Experts.",
    "H2: Discover more data solutions.",
    "H2: Talk to us about Data Strategy."
  ],
  "bodyText": "Data strategy that drives your business forward.\n\nThe right data strategy strengthens your business at its core – driving efficiency, productivity, and the objectives that matter most.\n\nTalk to us\nYour data defines your future.\n\nYour organisation’s data should be one of its most valuable assets – but without a clear and effective data strategy, its true value can’t be realised.\n\nWith strong data foundations, your organisation can adapt to changing market conditions, drive innovation, and make better decisions. Users are empowered to get more from data, whether they’re analysing metrics or using content to boost productivity.\n\nThe result creates lasting value – a consistent, referenceable way of working that backstops data policies and enables your workforce to perform at its best. \n\nAlign data to business goals.\n\nOur consultants shape data strategy to fit your organisation – your people, your challenges, and the outcomes you’re driving towards.\n\nImprove data quality, management, and usability.\n\nEnsure compliance, reduce exposure, and improve access through robust data management, supported by our expert data engineers and Workplace AI platform.\n\nAccelerate AI initiatives.\n\nAI is fuelled by clean, connected, and well-governed data. We help you ready your data for AI and focus on high-impact use cases for scalable success.\n\nBring your people with you.\n\nAdopting AI is as much about people as technology. We work with your teams to embed data governance and AI into real workflows, delivering meaningful value with minimal disruption.\n\n“In partnership with Aiimi, the quality of our data strategy – in particular its foresight and progressive data principles and capabilities – means the work remains incredibly relevant to Anglian Water and guides our development and progress.”\n\nMatt Edwards, CDO\n\nDon’t just plan it, build it.\n\nWondering where to go once your strategy is set? Our expert teams can support with data engineering, building digital products, or developing your interconnected AI strategy or digital transformation plans.\n\nYour complete data journey.\n\nWhether you need support getting started with data principles or want to ensure your most-valued data is ready for AI, we bring data strategy to life with interactive visual assets that are engaging and impactful.\n\nVision\nDefine a clear vision for data, aligned to business goals.\nData Principles/Information Charter\nData Principles/Information Charter – Establish core commitments that guide how data is handled and valued.\nData Strategy\nOutline strategic priorities and actions needed to achieve them.\nData Capability Framework\nAssess and develop the skills, tools, and structures to deliver on data ambitions.\nData Policies\nEnsure responsible, secure, compliant use of data with the right policies in place.\nData Management Framework\nBuild a structured approach for managing, maintaining, and improving data.\nRoadmap\nDefine a clear, phased plan to implement data strategy and track its progress.\nData strategies that are relied on by the world's\nbest-run companies. \nView all Case Studies\nCreating a three-year Al roadmap for the Government's Insolvency Service.\nView Case Study\nMeet the Aiimi Experts.\n\nWe’re responsive and able to source the right team rapidly, so you get the A team every time – whether you’re facing an unprecedented event or need to jump on an opportunity. \n\nGet in touch to discover Aiimi\nDiscover more data solutions.\n\nAI Data Governance\nWorkplace AI Platform\nData Science & Analytics\nData Engineering\nTalk to us about Data Strategy.\n\nTo find out more about our consulting services and how we can help, just fill in the form and we'll be in touch within one working day.\n\nFirst Name*\nLast Name*\nEmail*\nPhone\nMessage\nHow did you first hear about us?\nPlease select\nSearch engine (e.g. Google, Bing)\nSocial media\nAI (ChatGPT, Copilot, Claude, etc)\nEvent or Webinar\nOnline advertisement\nNews or media article\nPodcast\nOfficial Aiimi Partner\nReview site (e.g. Gartner, G2)\nReferred by an Aiimi customer\nWord of mouth\nColleague or employer\nOther\nFrom time to time, we would like to contact you about our products, services, events and other content that we think will be of interest to you. You can unsubscribe from these communications at any time.\nYes please - I’d like to hear more from Aiimi!\nBy submitting this form you consent to us processing and storing the information you provide in accordance with our Privacy Policy\nSUBMIT"
